    "regime_notes": "Daily paper IC and ICIR exceed the benchmark admission gates, but the factor is conditional and has only 333 valid daily cross-sectional observations. Regime IC was +0.033267 in 2020-22, -0.005919 in 2023-24, +0.037002 in 2025-26, and -0.017986 in 2027-28. Multi-day decay is negative, so any use should be low-weight and limited to one-day signal horizons.",
